## NIH OAuth 2.0 Flow

```
Browser                     Frontend (UI)              Auth Service             NIH SSO
  │                            │                          │                       │
  │──── Click Login ──────────►│                          │                       │
  │                            │──── Redirect ───────────────────────────────────►│
  │                            │     GET /auth/oauth/v2/authorize                 │
  │                            │     ?client_id=...&redirect_uri=...              │
  │                            │     &response_type=code&scope=openid email profile
  │                            │     &prompt=login                                │
  │                            │                          │                       │
  │◄─── NIH Login Page ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
  │──── Enter Credentials ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────►  │
  │                            │                          │                       │
  │◄─── Redirect with code ───│◄──────────────────────────────────────────────── │
  │                            │                          │                       │
  │                            │──── POST /api/authn/login ──►│                   │
  │                            │     { code, redirectUri }     │                  │
  │                            │                          │──── POST /token ─────►│
  │                            │                          │◄─── access_token ─────│
  │                            │                          │──── GET /userinfo ───►│
  │                            │                          │◄─── user profile ─────│
  │                            │                          │                       │
  │                            │                          │ Check isLoginPermitted │
  │                            │                          │ Create session         │
  │                            │                          │ Log LoginEvent         │
  │                            │◄─── { name, email, timeout } │                   │
  │                            │     + Set-Cookie: connect.sid │                   │
  │◄─── Logged In ────────────│                          │                       │
```

### OAuth Configuration

| Config Key | Purpose | Example Value |
|---|---|---|
| `NIH_CLIENT_ID` | OAuth client ID | (from environment) |
| `NIH_CLIENT_SECRET` | OAuth client secret | (from environment) |
| `NIH_BASE_URL` | NIH STS base URL | `https://stsstg.nih.gov` |
| `NIH_REDIRECT_URL` | OAuth redirect URI | (app callback URL) |
| `NIH_AUTHORIZE_URL` | Authorization endpoint | `/auth/oauth/v2/authorize` |
| `NIH_TOKEN_URL` | Token exchange endpoint | `/auth/oauth/v2/token` |
| `NIH_USERINFO_URL` | User info endpoint | `/openid/connect/v1/userinfo` |
| `NIH_LOGOUT_URL` | Logout endpoint | `/connect/session/logout` |
| `NIH_SCOPE` | OAuth scopes | `openid email profile` |
| `NIH_PROMPT` | OAuth prompt type | `login` |

### IDP Detection

The service determines which Identity Provider was used based on the user's email domain:

| Email Domain | IDP Constant | Value |
|---|---|---|
| `@nih.gov` | `NIH` | `'nih'` |
| `@login.gov` | `LOGIN_GOV` | `'login.gov'` |
| (dev only) | `TEST` | `'test-idp'` |

