## User Permission Checking

On login, the service validates that the user is permitted to access the system:

```javascript
const isPermitted = await userService.isEmailAndIDPLoginPermitted(email, idp)
// Returns 403 with INACTIVE_USER error if not permitted
```

This check lives in the `crdc-datahub-database-drivers` submodule and queries the `users` MongoDB collection.

### User Roles

| Role Constant | Display Name |
|---|---|
| `ADMIN` | Admin |
| `FEDERAL_LEAD` | Federal Lead |
| `DC_POC` | Data Commons Personnel (DCP) |
| `SUBMITTER` | Submitter |
| `ORG_OWNER` | Organization Owner |
| `CURATOR` | Curator |
| `USER` | User |

### User Statuses

| Status | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `ACTIVE` | User can log in |
| `INACTIVE` | User blocked from login (403 on `/login`) |

