## Error Constants

| Constant | Message | When |
|---|---|---|
| `NOT_LOGGED_IN` | User is not logged in | No valid session on protected action |
| `INACTIVE_USER` | User is inactive | `isEmailAndIDPLoginPermitted` returns false |
| `INVALID_USER_STATUS` | Invalid user status | Unexpected user status value |
| `INVALID_USERID` | Invalid user ID | Bad user ID parameter |
| `INVALID_ROLE` | Invalid role | Unrecognized role value |
| `MONGODB_HEALTH_CHECK_FAILED` | Health check failed | MongoDB unreachable (503 on `/version`) |

